	Donc, \( \mbox{Ker}(u-2Id) = \mbox{Vect}(e_3) \) où \( e_3 = (0,0,3,-2) \).

	\item[-Cas \( \lambda = 3 \).] Soit \( (x,y,z,t)\in\Cc^4 \).

	\begin{align*}\ensuremath (x,y,z,t)\in\mbox{Ker}(u-Id) & \Leftrightarrow\left\{
		\begin{array}{l}
