	\end{array}
	\right) \) et \( J = \left(
	\begin{array}{cc}
		1 & 1 \\
		0 & 1
	\end{array}
	\right) \). Soit \( E = \{M(x,y) = xI+yJ,\;(x,y)\in\Rr^2\} \).

	\begin{enumerate}
